// The module name is what other packages inside this project use to import
// each other. Here we choose "filereader" as the module name, which means the
// internal package will be imported as "filereader/internal/jsonstore".
module filereader

// The Go language version this module is written for. The toolchain uses this
// to enable/disable language features (e.g. generics need >= 1.18).
go 1.18
